*Limitation of Array 
--------------------------
--> the size of  the array is fixed we cannot reduce or increase dynamically during the execution of the program.
--> Array is collection of homogeneous elements.
--> array manipulation such as 
    1. remove an element from on array.
    2.adding the element in b/w the array etc 

** therefore to avoid the limitaion of the array we can store the group of the object or element using diffrent data structure 
   such as 
   1. list 
   2. set 
   3. Queue
   4. map/dictionaries

collection of fromework :--
 collection framework is set of classes and interfaces which provide mechanism to slove group of object (element ) toString 

 ** it also provide mechanism to perform actions such as 
    1.CRUD operation 
    2.access the elemrnt
    3.create and add an element 
    4.remove and delete the element 
    5.search element 

different between array and collection
 
 Array                              | collection
1. Array is fixed size              | 1. it is not fixed size
2. Accepts homogeneous data         | 2. Can accept heterogeneous data
3. Accepts both PD and NPD Data     | 3. it will only accept NPD 
4. Array does not Support generic   | 4. Collection support generic 

